{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16207583","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207583","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1620758301:0":{"text":"怎么样，你身体还好吗？有感觉到爱情魔药的残留吗？","source_cn":"怎么样，你身体还好吗？有感觉到爱情魔药的残留吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9AB3B7DAE691BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620758302:0":{"text":"我刚刚喝下的是爱情魔药？糟了……我、我做错事了……","source_cn":"我刚刚喝下的是爱情魔药？糟了……我、我做错事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212A77441C5F8F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620758303:1":{"text":"做错事？","source_cn":"做错事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4478CA9D215E843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620758304:1":{"text":"我以前为了制造“惊喜”，曾冒昧地向蕾娜公开表白过好几次，她都没有答应……","source_cn":"我以前为了制造“惊喜”，曾冒昧地向蕾娜公开表白过好几次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091A126ADCD46EAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620758305:1":{"text":"刚才我突然明白过来，真正的爱情不是一厢情愿，而是双方的共鸣。可我、我居然在和蕾娜还不够熟悉的时候就贸然公开向她表白，给她带来了很大的困扰……","source_cn":"刚才我突然明白过来，真正的爱情不是一厢情愿，而是双方的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1768182ACEC3FAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620758306:1":{"text":"我决定了，我现在就去向蕾娜道歉！谢谢你们的关心！","source_cn":"我决定了，我现在就去向蕾娜道歉！谢谢你们的关心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC75EA8CD10FCEF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620758307:1":{"text":"欸……没想到爱情魔药还有这样的功效啊。","source_cn":"欸……没想到爱情魔药还有这样的功效啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB0C387323AE08A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"皮帕","source":"皮帕","status":"source"},"speaker:西瑞尔":{"text":"西瑞尔","source":"西瑞尔","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}